Note: `.game-fact dd` color text, `.fact-warn` overrides to warn — rule order matters; `.fact-warn` after `.game-fact dd` wins by specificity? `.game-fact dd` = 0,1,1; `.fact-warn` = 0,1,0 → `.game-fact dd` wins! Bad. Use `.game-fact dd.fact-warn` / `.game-fact dd.fact-ok`.

