Default `[stopUs]` marks the single game end at the stop → spans [0, stop] for 1-game sessions, matching old behaviour. For the 2-game illegal test at 301, no report is built past the illegal check (buildReport refuses before alignment? alignment happens before engine, but illegal move check is before alignment → fine!). Illegal check occurs before alignment, so marks don't matter there.

