Test "uses one PGN snapshot..." etc. — single game.

Tests that assert `alignmentMode === 'endtime'` or `toleranceSec`? grep.

Also "keeps the previous report and PGNs byte-identical after a PGN failure" — report rebuilt with same marks → same bytes. Since marks are in meta (unchanged), fine.

